/*
 * Declares the DtorSymbol class.
 * 
 * DtorSymbol represents the semantic information associated with a
 * destructor declaration (`DtorDecl`) inside a class. It stores the
 * syntactic declaration, the validated prototype and body, and the class that
 * owns the destructor.
 * 
 * <hr>
 * 
